#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:25
msgid ""
"This elementary lesson shows you how to install PLUMED and some basic and "
"more advanced syntax. You will only need to complete up to exercise 1 of "
"this earlier lesson to complete these exercises on statistical errors."
msgstr ""
"PLUMED "
"のインストール方法と、基本的な構文から発展的な構文までを紹介する入門レッスン。この統計誤差の演習に取り組むには、前のレッスンの演習1まで終えていれば十分である。"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:26
msgid ""
"A lecture that was given on February 1st 2021 as part of the plumed "
"masterclass series that introduces you to the exercises in this lesson"
msgstr "2021年2月1日に PLUMED Masterclass シリーズの一環として行われた、このレッスンの演習を紹介する講義"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:27
msgid "The instructions for the exercises"
msgstr "演習の手順"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:28
msgid ""
"A python notebook that shows how the data sets in the files "
"uncorrelated_data, correlated_data and weighted data that are all used in "
"the exericses was generated"
msgstr ""
"演習で用いる uncorrelated_data、correlated_data、weighted data "
"の各データセットをどのように生成したかを示す Python Notebook"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:29
msgid ""
"A python notebook file that explains how you can work on the exercises from "
"a python notebook. Advice on running PLUMED from a notebook and on plotting "
"the data that is generated is given."
msgstr ""
"Python Notebook 上で演習に取り組む方法を説明するファイル。Notebook から PLUMED "
"を実行する方法と、生成されたデータを描画する方法についての助言を含む。"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:30
msgid ""
"A lecture that was given on February 8th 2021 as part of the plumed "
"masterclass series that goes through the solutions to the exercises in the "
"lesson"
msgstr "2021年2月8日に PLUMED Masterclass シリーズの一環として行われた、このレッスンの演習の解答を解説する講義"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:31
msgid ""
"A python notebook file that provides a complete set of solutions to the "
"exercises"
msgstr "演習の解答一式を収録した Python Notebook"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:32
msgid ""
"A second python notebook file that contains solutions to the exercises. In "
"this notebook a different method has been used to generate the figures "
"showing the final free energy surfaces."
msgstr ""
"演習の解答を収録した2つ目の Python Notebook。この Notebook では、最終的な自由エネルギー面の図を別の方法で生成している。"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:33
msgid "Some advice on installing PLUMED so you can do this exercise"
msgstr "この演習に取り組むための PLUMED のインストールに関する助言"
